<p>You draw kinetic energy from your surroundings to replenish your Psi.</p><p>This will slow all targets within radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 2, 3, 3</acronym> by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>psi 50%">15%, 16%, 17%, 18%, 19%</acronym> (max <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">16%, 17%, 18%, 19%, 20%</acronym>) for four turns, draining <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100,<br>psi 50%">26, 35, 41, 47, 52</acronym> (max <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">38, 52, 62, 71, 79</acronym>) stamina from each.</p><p>You replenish <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>psi 50%">10, 13, 15, 18, 20</acronym> (max <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15, 20, 23, 27, 30</acronym>) Psi from the first target, with each additional target restoring 20% less than the one before it.</p><p>The strength of these effects increases as your Psi depletes and with your Mindpower.</p>